$$
\text{Space diagonal} = s\sqrt{3}
$$

So, the ratio of the largest distance between two corners of the hypercube to the side length of the hypercube is:

$$
\frac{s\sqrt{3}}{s} = \sqrt{3}
$$

Therefore, the ratio is \(\sqrt{3}\).

